1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,250
He goes further.

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:12,851
Mainstream Orthodox Judaism holds that the whole cosmos exists so that rabbis can study their scriptures, and that if they stopped, even distant galaxies would be annihilated.

3
00:00:12,851 --> 00:00:18,190
Secular Jews, too, see their people as the central heroes of history.

4
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:19,765
Why choose his own people?

5
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:24,505
Because it is more polite to criticise one's own people than foreigners.

6
00:00:24,505 --> 00:00:30,742
He leaves it to readers everywhere to puncture the hot air balloons inflated by their own tribes.

